<section>
<title>Detailed Description</title>

<para>Class <link linkend="_class_tool_bruno">ToolBruno</link></para>

<para>This class represents the Bruno tool module in the <link linkend="_namespace_bearsampp">Bearsampp</link> application. It extends the abstract <link linkend="_class_module">Module</link> class and provides specific functionalities for managing the Bruno IDE tool, including setting versions, and retrieving the executable path. </para>
<para>
