    <title>reload()</title>
<indexterm><primary>reload</primary><secondary>ToolBruno</secondary></indexterm>
<indexterm><primary>ToolBruno</primary><secondary>reload</secondary></indexterm>
<para><computeroutput>reload ( $id = <computeroutput>null</computeroutput>
,  $type = <computeroutput>null</computeroutput>
)</computeroutput></para>
<para>Reloads the module configuration based on the provided ID and type.</para>

<para>This method overrides the parent reload method to include additional configurations specific to the Bruno tool. It sets the name, version, and executable path, and logs errors if the module is not properly configured.</para>

